# "Attack YOU" (CR 508.1): a creature attacking Bot1's planeswalker does not attack Bot1, so Sabotage Strategist does nothing. Bot2's
# Savannah Lions (power 2) attacks The Theorist, Jace Beleren on turn 4 and takes her from 3 loyalty to 1; weakened it would
# have taken her to 2. Bot1 takes no damage.

